==English==
{{wikipedia}}

===Etymology===
From obsolete {{etyl|fr|en}} {{term|prominence|lang=fr}} (compare {{term|proéminence|lang=fr}}), from {{etyl|la|en}} {{lena}} {{term|prominentia|lang=la}}.

===Noun===
{{en-noun|~|prominences}}

# The state of being [[prominent]]: widely known or [[eminent]]
# [[relative]] [[importance]]
# A [[bulge]]: something that bulges out or is [[protuberant]] or [[project]]s from a form
# (''topography'') Autonomous height; relative height or prime factor; a concept used in the categorization of [[hill]]s and [[mountain]]s

